The Volkswagen up! 'beats' edition was available in the later years of the up!'s production, including 2020. It was primarily offered with the 1.0L 60 PS (59 bhp) engine, although some earlier versions had the 75 PS or even the 90 PS TSI engine. The key feature of the 'beats' trim is the upgraded Beats Audio sound system. I will evaluate based on the 1.0L 60 PS engine as it appears to be the most common in the later 'beats' models.

